{"login": "mukappalambda", "location": "Taipei", "commits": [{"sha": "f247a596ec51a55f8cb0c97d2f96440c5cd1aa53", "message": "refactor: change jupyter notebook to python code", "created_at": "2022-11-24T14:57:11Z", "repo": "simulated-annealing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "49e61bd082abe8a5628c2c6c9a64594eab8a1ec6", "message": "Add simulated annealing animation.", "created_at": "2020-12-20T10:16:46Z", "repo": "simulated-annealing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0fddf8914f9b34b7b2d2a8de545be5fe3848d2e6", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2020-12-20T10:13:29Z", "repo": "simulated-annealing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d80e2e70b61e38a10cd38713c503422e7f21ef00", "message": "\ud83d\udc1b fix(uv): correct dev dependency configuration in pyproject.toml (#39) (#40)\n\nMove dev tools from tool.group.dev.dependencies to dependency-groups.dev, update ruff version constraint, and ensure uv build backend reads development dependencies correctly.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T01:53:28Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b69966afbf9b3f9fdaea08dd709d72ed37031e0", "message": "37 migrate to uv (#38)\n\n* \ud83d\ude9a build(uv): migrate from Poetry to uv toolchain (#37)\n\nReplace Poetry with uv in mise.toml, switch build-system to uv_build, add uv build-backend config, and commit uv.lock to ensure reproducible dependency resolution.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* \u26a1\ufe0f docs(readme): migrate build/install instructions from Poetry to uv (#37)\n\nUpdate README to use `uv build` and direct wheel installation via pip, replacing Poetry commands and clarifying the expected wheel filename and location.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T01:43:14Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f042fede42a62d5638447f095b3b2a8f3d664883", "message": "\u2795 chore(dev-deps): add pylint and pyright (#35) (#36)\n\nAdd missing development dependencies to pyproject.toml by including pylint and pyright, improving linting and static type checking during development.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T01:13:36Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "58f0fb8e8dd0e288b743c77565095fc16806c9f6", "message": "\ud83d\udcdd docs(readme): add missing table of contents (#33) (#34)\n\nAdd a Table of Contents section to README with anchors for install, examples, uninstall, and history to improve navigation and discoverability.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T01:08:26Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9e000d099b2014b6662c5cd1604094f6c7d6498b", "message": "\ud83d\udd12 fix(deps): bump pillow to 12.1.1 (#31) (#32)\n\nUpdate Pillow dependency in poetry.lock to address security vulnerabilities, refresh package metadata, and align Python compatibility requirements with the new release.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T00:57:09Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "243b76494b64f8932b3ae581fa057069ad221306", "message": "\u2795 chore(deps): add mise configuration for Python and Poetry (#29) (#30)\n\nIntroduce mise.toml pinning python 3.11 and poetry 2.2.1 to standardize local tool versions, improve reproducibility, and simplify dependency management across environments.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <45162039+mukappalambda@users.noreply.github.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T00:50:26Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "321f1188080898e3d29a469ad7d827300644e394", "message": "\ud83d\udcda docs(readme): Improve README with clearer descriptions and examples (#27)\n\nUpdated the README to provide a more concise overview of the package and its primary functionalities, along with informative references and usage examples.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:23:09Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4e29a194a23ae81d1a3bd1d2b41475ae0166055b", "message": "\ud83d\udd27 docs(README): add badges for Dependabot updates and Ruff (#26)\n\nAdded markdown badges to the README for Dependabot updates and Ruff to enhance visibility and maintainability of the project.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:08:06Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "36955b7c1c10c00baa28f6fc3437d0052ec0a8e5", "message": "\ud83d\udd27 chore(workflow): update ruff-action to version 3.5.1 (#25)\n\nUpdated the workflow to use the latest version of ruff-action for improved performance and compatibility with current dependencies.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:03:54Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "83760b29ebf24b99b24bdf5179ca19c26f21082e", "message": "\ud83d\udd27 chore(workflow): update checkout action to version v6.0.1 (#24)\n\nUpdated the checkout action in the Ruff workflow to use version v6.0.1 for improved stability and performance.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:57:42Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "07b17a024365e56f097712419e9fb8986bf9d0c5", "message": "\ud83d\udd27 fix(fonts): update fonttools to version 4.61.0 (#23)\n\nUpdated fonttools dependency from version 4.60.0 to 4.61.0. Adjusted Python version requirement to \u22653.10. This also includes corresponding changes in wheel files.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:53:49Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ce4cd87cd10273db10c426f10a292b0317b50353", "message": "\ud83d\udc77 CI(github-actions): bump ruff version from `0.9.9` to `0.13.1` (#21)\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:16:39Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d66a680a1badf221cf6231c649cff4c7dc93ef3", "message": "\u2b06\ufe0f build(dev-deps): bump ruff version from `0.9.10` to `0.13.1` (#20)\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:13:29Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "06410c4efe6d2ddf80b322714027aa5ac297b298", "message": "\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f build(poetry): bump poetry version from `2.1.1` to `2.2.0` (#19)\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:09:18Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "727a4521a05743cecbee4687c83c8e50130783fd", "message": "\ud83d\udd25 chore(python-version): remove unused file (#18)\n\nSigned-off-by: Mao-Kai Lan <maokailan24@gmail.com>", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:01:39Z", "repo": "dmd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c51917ca787f5706e4448788351ae61dd116bdd4", "message": "Chore/license add (#16)\n\n* \ud83d\udcc4 chore(license): add `LICENSE`\n\n* \ud83d\udd27 build(pyprojec